WEBVTT

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:05.060
Sometimes when you're knitting,
the edge stitches don't form properly.

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:10.090
This could be caused by knitting too fast
or taking the carriage out too far past

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.260
the knitting, pulling
that working yarn tight.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.820
If you find your carriage is jamming,

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:18.780
watch for the formation
of those edge stitches.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.620
Notice the position of the needle butts

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:26.560
and manually push them back,
readjusting those misformed stitches.

